        quotation: In 1968 he travels to Japan where he meets Master Shigeru Egami. Very impressed by Master Egami and the technique he observes, he decides to make a profound and very difficult transformation in his technique and his practice. He returns to Europe as the representative of the Nihon Karate-do Shotokai.
